[TITLE]
AquaOptima dPHM-PINN Sprint 11 — small reference EPANET .inp fixture
Five-node looped distribution sample: one reservoir + four junctions,
five pipes. SI flow units (LPS), Hazen-Williams head loss. Solvable
by aquaoptima.dphm.newton_solve with default options. Intentionally
tiny so the topology is inspectable in a single screen.

[JUNCTIONS]
;ID   Elev   Demand   Pattern
 J1   0.0    10.0     ;     ; 10 L/s consumer
 J2   0.0    15.0     ;     ; 15 L/s consumer
 J3   0.0    12.0     ;     ; 12 L/s consumer
 J4   0.0     8.0     ;     ;  8 L/s consumer

[RESERVOIRS]
;ID   Head   Pattern
 R1   100.0  ;          ; 100 m fixed head reservoir

[PIPES]
;ID   Node1   Node2   Length   Diameter   Roughness   MinorLoss   Status
 P1   R1      J1      300.0    250.0      130.0       0.0         OPEN
 P2   J1      J2      250.0    200.0      130.0       0.0         OPEN
 P3   J2      J3      220.0    150.0      130.0       0.0         OPEN
 P4   J3      J4      200.0    150.0      130.0       0.0         OPEN
 P5   J1      J4      280.0    150.0      130.0       0.0         OPEN

[OPTIONS]
 Units                LPS
 Headloss             H-W

[END]
